  "description": "Morán, a man whose only asset is his face! Just as he was dumped by his live-in lover and faced homelessness, he falls for Ho-Su's sweet talk when he appears claiming to like him.\n\n *“Hyung, you won't have to worry about money anymore.”*\n\nWell, for a while, I guess I'll live in a nice place with this young, rich, cute boy. Morán thought it was nothing but a lighthearted idea, but he gradually became entangled with Ho-Su, who showered him with passionate attention and affection... \n\nThis young boyfriend... something about him feels off...?\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
